{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/63972","id":2900932053,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde86s6LXV","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63972","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63972.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63972.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63972","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/63972/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/63972/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63972/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/statuses/76a1fde800e30dfe76441c2fd2ba186d522c3a59","number":63972,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix hot reload for Blazor route changes","user":{"login":"oroztocil","id":79744616,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NzQ0NjE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79744616?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil","html_url":"https://github.com/oroztocil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes two bugs that prevented hot reload from applying changes in Blazor routes.\r\n\r\n### Premature change token disposal\r\n\r\nA bug introduced in https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/53750 caused the change token used by `RazorComponentEndpointDataSource` to be disposed before the callback registered on the token is invoked. This means that `UpdateEndpoints` is not being called at all during hot reload.\r\n\r\nThis PR does not remove the token disposal so that the memory leak is not re-introduced. Instead, the PR moves the disposal of the current token to `UpdateEndpoints` itself. This is valid because the role of the change token is precisely to trigger the update and the token is replaced at the end of `UpdateEndpoints` with a new one (as before).\r\n\r\n### Stale route data\r\n\r\nThe first bug was previously hiding a further problem in how we cache route data used by the main ASP.NET Core routing. This data was computed once during application start up and then reused in every `UpdateEndpoints` invocation. This means that we did not re-scan the assemblies for added, modified, or removed routes.\r\n\r\nThe PR changes the implementation of `RazorComponentEndpointDataSource` and related types so that we do not store a pre-built instance of `ComponentApplicationBuilder`. Instead we store a list of configuration actions that were invoked for the current `RazorComponentEndpointDataSource`. When the route data needs to be updated, these actions are replayed on a new `ComponentApplicationBuilder` instance, thus ensuring an up-to-date state. Note that this follows the same pattern as we already use for endpoint conventions.\r\n\r\n### Result\r\n\r\nAfter the change, hot reload works as expected in the following scenarios:\r\n\r\n- A route is changed or added for an existing page.\r\n- A route is added for a new page.\r\n\r\nHot reload still does not work when deleting a page with route.\r\n\r\n\r\nFixes #52582","labels":[{"id":1164776385,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTY0Nzc2Mzg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-blazor","name":"area-blazor","description":"Includes: Blazor, Razor Components","color":"5319e7","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":13536541,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAQzde84Azo0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/362","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestone/362","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/362/labels","number":362,"state":"closed","title":"11.0-preview1","description":"","creator":{"login":"wtgodbe","id":14283640,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjgzNjQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14283640?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe","html_url":"https://github.com/wtgodbe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":469,"created_at":"2025-08-21T15:54:42Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T17:55:18Z","closed_at":"2026-04-27T13:39:39Z","due_on":"2026-02-10T00:00:00Z"},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-09T14:17:06Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T18:25:43Z","closed_at":"2025-10-09T18:25:23Z","merged_at":"2025-10-09T18:25:23Z","merge_commit_sha":"982cae2c12aeb6fffd91cbe980353304a5ad8a96","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"lewing","id":24063,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24063?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lewing","html_url":"https://github.com/lewing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lewing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lewing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lewing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lewing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lewing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lewing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lewing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lewing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lewing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},{"login":"tmat","id":41759,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41759?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmat","html_url":"https://github.com/tmat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"dotnet:oroztocil/blazor-route-hot-reload","ref":"oroztocil/blazor-route-hot-reload","repo":{"id":17620347,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNzYyMDM0Nw==","name":"aspnetcore","full_name":"dotnet/aspnetcore","owner":{"login":"dotnet","id":9141961,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjkxNDE5NjE=","avatar_url":"